---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../../lib/links';
---

<Base title="What's new in 3.1">
  <main class="prose">
    <h1>What's new in 3.1</h1>

    <h2>Sync and backup with Google Drive</h2>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/releases/3.1/sync.gif"
        height="400"
        alt="Syncing styles with Google Drive"
      />
    </figure>
    <p>
      Turn on and authorize sync with Google Drive from the Stylebot{' '}
      <strong>Options page</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Once it's on, click <strong>Sync Now</strong> in the popup or the Options
      page to sync your browser's styles with the ones backed up on Google
      Drive.
    </p>

    <h2>Resize the Stylebot editor</h2>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/releases/3.1/resize.gif"
        height="400"
        alt="Resizing the Stylebot editor"
      />
    </figure>
    <p>
      You can now resize the Stylebot editor, and optionally have the page
      shrink so its content doesn't sit under the editor.
    </p>

    <h2>Color palettes</h2>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/releases/3.1/colors.gif"
        height="400"
        alt="Picking a color from a palette"
      />
    </figure>
    <p>
      An improved color picker with palettes makes it easier to pick good
      colors.
    </p>

    <h2>
      And lots of <a href={LINKS.changelog}>bug fixes</a>
    </h2>
  </main>
</Base>
